 * Math: 123.456
 * Decimal:
   * Match ^.* -> Apply [2] -> 123.46
   * Match ^[SN].* -> Fail.
   * Result: 123.46
 * Padding:
   * Match ^.* -> Apply [19,2] -> 0000000000000123.46
   * Match ^[SN].* -> Fail.
   * Final: 0000000000000123.46
Case 2: Row S01... (Value: 123.456)
 * Math: 123.456
 * Decimal:
   * Match ^.* -> Apply [2] -> 123.46
   * Match ^[SN].* -> Pass. Apply [0] -> 123
   * Result: 123
 * Padding:
   * Match ^.* -> Apply [19,2] -> 0000000000000123.46 (Intermediate step)
   * Match ^[SN].* -> Pass. Apply [19,0] (Re-format 123) -> 0000000000000000123
   * Final: 0000000000000000123 (No decimal!)
